    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kuno nikwo omukabo okwakwila oluyia lwaManase; okhuba niye omwana wambeli waYusufu. Makhiri, omwana wambeli waManase, owali samwana Gileadi, yakabilwa Gileadi naBashani, shichila yali omundu welihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikukabilwa abatong'a khubaana baManase, ebilibwa biabwe shinga olwa biali; mbu abaana baAbiezeri, nabaana baHeleki, nabaana baAsirieli, nabaana baShekhemu, nabaana baHeferi, nabaana baShemida; abo nibo abaana abasiani baManase waYusufu, ebilibwa biabwe shinga olwa biali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Zelofehadi waHeferi waGileadi waMakhiri waManase shiyali nomwana omusiani yesi ta, habula abakhaana bonyene; nameera kabakhaanabe ngakano, mbu Mala naNoa naHogila naMilika naTiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibeetsa imbeli waEleazari omukuhani, khandi imbeli waYoswa waNuni, khandi imbeli wabakhulundu, nibasunga bari OMWAMI yalaka Musa okhukhuheelesia obulaame mubaana beefwe. Mana lilako liOMWAMI shinga olwa liali, yabaheelesia obulaame mubasamwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Manase nakabilwa ebitonye ekhumi, khandi nende eshialo shiaGileadi naBashani, injelekha waYorodani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shichila abakhaana baManase bakabilwa obulaame halala nabasianibe; nashio eshialo shiaGileadi nishiba shiabandi abatong'a khubaana baManase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne eshialo shiaManase shiarula eAsheri okhuula eMikimetsatsi, elili ebukwe waShekhemu; olwakho nilutsiililila khumukhono musaatsa okhuula khubamenyanga muEni-tapua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshialo shiene shiaTapua shiali shiaManase; nebutswa Tapua eliokhulwakho lwaManase liali eliabaana baEfuraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwakho nilukholomokha okhuula khumuchela kwaKana, khuluchelekha lwasautsi Iwomuchela; amataala ako kali akaEfuraimu hakari wamataala kaManase; ne olwakho lwaManase lwali injelekha womuchela enotsi, neshihesi shialwo hanyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elubeka lwasautsi, eshialo shiali eshiaEfuraimu; ne elubeka lwanotsi, shiali eshiaManase; ne inyanza yali olwakholwe; nishioola khuAsheri enotsi, ne khuIsakhari ebukwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi muIsakhari naAsheri, Manase yali nende Betsi-sheani namataala kalio, naIbileamu namataala kalio, nabamenyanga muDori namataala kalio, nabamenyanga muEndori namataala kalio, nabamenyanga muTaanakhi namataala kalio, nabamenyanga muMegido namataala kalio, nende eshitonye shiakhataru shieNefetsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa abaana baManase bakhaywa okhurusia abomumataala ako; ne abaKanaani balumilila okhumenya mushialo eshio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula olwa abaana baIsiraeli bali nibameeteeshe amaani, babalunyia abaKanaani nibabakhola abasumba, nibarabarusilia elala ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baYusufu nibasunjila Yoswa bari Nishiina eshichilile niumba omukabo mulala neshitonye shilala khulwa obulaame, olwa endi oluyia olukhongo, shichila okhuula bulaano OMWAMI yambeelesinjia ikhabi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa nababoolela mbu Noba noli oluyia olukhongo, otsie mumutsuru, orematsacheyo mushialo shiabaPerizi neshiabaRefaimu, olwa oluutsi mbu eshialo shiebikulu shiaEfuraimu neshinyelele eshiramuhela ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baYusufu nibakalusia mbu Eshialo tsana shiebikulu shishikhuhela ta; nabo abaKanaani bosi abamenya mushialo shielibanda bali namakaari keshibia, mbu abali muBetsi-sheani namataala kalio, nende abomwibanda liaYezereeli bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa naboolela abeinzu yaYusufu, mbu Efuraimu naManase, ari Oli oluyia olukhongo, noli nobunyali obukhongo; shiolaba nomukabo mulala kwonyene ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula eshialo shiebikulu shilaba eshishio. Okhuba kata olwa kuli omutsuru, olakuremaka, kube okukwo okhuula khushihesi; olarusiamwo abaKanaani, kata olwa bali namakaari keshibia, khandi kata olwa bali abamaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
